Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.83,0:22:34.04,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}No caminho de volta para casa, sussurrei sem querer,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:38.84,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}com uma voz que quase se perdia no som do vento.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:43.01,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Mesmo sem eu dizer o resto da frase,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.01,0:22:47.43,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}você me acolhe e compreende com todo carinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:51.60,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Às vezes faltam palavras
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:55.73,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}pra expressar direito o que eu sinto...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:59.86,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Mas, mesmo assim, a sua bondade
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:05.95,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}quase me faz chorar um pouco.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.95,0:23:10.25,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Eu nem cheguei a pedir nada...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.25,0:23:15.79,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}como você consegue notar sempre?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.79,0:23:20.76,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Gosto desse seu jeito de entender tudo de verdade,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.76,0:23:26.01,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}sem nem precisar dizer "eu já sei".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:28.18,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Eu te amo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.35,0:23:32.39,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Como você sempre se lembrava das minhas coisas,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.39,0:23:38.82,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}hoje eu também consigo gostar de quem eu sou.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:44.95,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}A luz que a sua gentileza me deu...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.95,0:23:49.49,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}é como se colocasse um laço no meu coração.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.49,0:23:53.37,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Agora é a minha vez,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.37,0:23:58.63,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}então olha só pra mim aqui do seu lado.
